  "project_description": "The Block Button Modal module allows you to show a block's content in a modal dialog. The block is still rendered in the page, but only a button is visible; clicking the button opens the already-rendered block content inside a core jQuery-UI modal dialog. It adds no routes, permissions, services or plugins — it is a single third-party setting on the block config form plus a theme override and a small client-side behavior.",
